ms1-firmware/third_party/ holds parts of the original firmware of the Märklin Mobile Station 1
(the locomotive database and the update file loader); they are
not covered by the Apache License (ms1-firmware/third_party/README.md). The firmware's
read-only tables in ms1-firmware/src/ (menu texts, font, display maps and the like) hold the
original's contents. The original firmware's update files and dumps, its disassembly and
decompiled code, and the vendors' datasheets and protocol documents are not included;
README.md describes what the tools expect.

